            "review_title": "Review at Cachette Cafe",
            "review_text": "Thomas B\nVietnam10 contributions\n0\nMy favourite quiet spot in Hanoi\nSep 2016 • Couples\nThis place is out of this world. You climb the stairs and enter a little air-conditioned bubble of chilled music, coffee and cats. It was a welcome break from the hostel I was staying in at the time! \n\nLovely outdoor balcony for street watching and dart breaks, good internet, friendly and unobtrusive staff. Even has a tattoo shop above if you're keen. \n\nBy far my favourite rest stop if I'm in the area.\nRead more\nWritten September 21, 2016",
